{"id":"2024-new-gaokao-1-17","year":2024,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"新高考I卷","regions":["山东","广东","湖南","湖北","河北","江苏","福建","浙江","河南","江西","安徽"],"question_no":17,"question_type":"solution","stem":"如图，四棱锥 $P-ABCD$ 中，$PA\\perp$ 底面 $ABCD$，且 $PA=AC=2$，$BC=1$，$AB=\\sqrt3$. \\mathrm{i}tem 若 $AD\\perp PB$，证明 $AD\\parallel$ 平面 $PBC$； \\mathrm{i}tem 若 $AD\\perp DC$，且二面角 $A-CP-D$ 的正弦值为 $\\frac{\\sqrt{42}}{7}$，求 $AD$. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate} [图]","options":null,"answer":"（1）证明略；（2）$AD=\\sqrt3$","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["二面角","空间向量"],"difficulty":"中档","needs_figure":true,"source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2024/2024新高考1(山东,广东,湖南,湖北,河北,江苏,福建,浙江,河南,江西,安徽).pdf","sha":"a408f5467da376f7335cdb397855fe07ddc87149","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"如图，四棱锥 \\(P-ABCD\\) 中，\\(PA\\perp\\) 底面 \\(ABCD\\)，且 \\(PA=AC=2\\)，\\(BC=1\\)，\\(AB=\\sqrt3\\).\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 若 \\(AD\\perp PB\\)，证明 \\(AD\\parallel\\) 平面 \\(PBC\\)；\n\\item 若 \\(AD\\perp DC\\)，且二面角 \\(A-CP-D\\) 的正弦值为 \\(\\frac{\\sqrt{42}}{7}\\)，求 \\(AD\\).\n\\end{enumerate}\n\n\\bitmapfigure[max width=6.0cm]{img/2024/new_gaokao_paper_1/q17_fig1.png}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）证明略；（2）$AD=\\sqrt3$","figure_refs":["img/2024/new_gaokao_paper_1/q17_fig1.png"],"figure_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation/4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8/img/2024/new_gaokao_paper_1/q17_fig1.png"],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2024/new_gaokao_paper_1.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"77b974d8d692363d60c8d436b6c8624428bb0108","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified_with_figure_dependency","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"b655ffc058b65ed55cda9981921bdde8cb