{"id":"2024-new-gaokao-1-18","year":2024,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"新高考I卷","regions":["山东","广东","湖南","湖北","河北","江苏","福建","浙江","河南","江西","安徽"],"question_no":18,"question_type":"solution","stem":"已知函数 $f(x)=\\ln\\frac{x}{2-x}+ax+b(x-1)^3$（$x\\mathrm{i}n(0,2)$）. \\mathrm{i}tem 若 $b=0$ 且 $f'(x)\\ge0$，求 $a$ 的最小值； \\mathrm{i}tem 证明：曲线 $y=f(x)$ 关于点 $(1,a)$ 中心对称； \\mathrm{i}tem 若 $f(x)>-2$ 当且仅当 $1<x<2$，求 $b$ 的取值范围. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate}","options":null,"answer":"（1）$-2$；（2）证明略；（3）$b\\ge-\\frac23$","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["导数在研究函数中的作用","函数的对称性"],"difficulty":"中档","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2024/2024新高考1(山东,广东,湖南,湖北,河北,江苏,福建,浙江,河南,江西,安徽).pdf","sha":"a408f5467da376f7335cdb397855fe07ddc87149","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"已知函数\n\\(f(x)=\\ln\\frac{x}{2-x}+ax+b(x-1)^3\\)（\\(x\\in(0,2)\\)）.\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 若 \\(b=0\\) 且 \\(f'(x)\\ge0\\)，求 \\(a\\) 的最小值；\n\\item 证明：曲线 \\(y=f(x)\\) 关于点 \\((1,a)\\) 中心对称；\n\\item 若 \\(f(x)>-2\\) 当且仅当 \\(1<x<2\\)，求 \\(b\\) 的取值范围.\n\\end{enumerate}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）$-2$；（2）证明略；（3）$b\\ge-\\frac23$","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2024/new_gaokao_paper_1.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"77b974d8d692363d60c8d436b6c8624428bb0108","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"858051b0985c9615a12a1a9a59431e3d717d2912bb189cd3b304efb12412307c","answer_sha256":"c542e701316d464f3d1450010b146245972e7d41cac1568f6da9722bc63899f8"}}
{"id":"2024-new-gaokao-1-19","year":2024,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"新高考I卷","regions":["山东","广东","湖南","湖北","河北","江苏","福建","浙江","河南","江西","安徽"],"question_no":19,"question_type":"solution","stem":"设 $m$ 为正整数，数列 $a_1$，$a_2$，$\\dots$，$a_{4m+2}$ 为公差不为 $0$ 的等差数列，若删去两项 $a_i$，$a_j$（$i<j$） 后剩余 $4m$ 项可平均分为 $m$ 组且每组 4 个数都成等差，则称该数列为 $(i,j)$-可分数列. \\mathrm{i}tem 写出所有 $(i,j)$，$1\\le i<j\\le6$，使 $a_1$，$\\dots$，$a_6$ 是 $(i,j)$-可分数列； \\mathrm{i}tem 当 $m\\ge3$ 时，证明 $a_1$，$\\dots$，$a_{4m+2}$ 是 $(2,13)$-可分数列； \\mathrm{i}tem 从 $1$，$2$，$\\dots$，$4m+2$ 中不放回任取 $i<j$，设 $a_1$，$\\dots$，$a_{4m+2}$ 是 $(i,j)$-可分数列的概率为 $P_m$，证明 $P_m>\\frac18$. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate}","options":null,"answer":"（1）$(1,2),(1,6),(5,6)$；（2）证明略；（3）证明略","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["古典概型","等差数列","组合构造"],"difficulty":"难题","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2024/2024新高考1(山东,广东,湖南,湖北,河北,江苏,福建,浙江,河南,江西,安徽).pdf","sha":"a408f5467da376f7335cdb397855fe07ddc87149","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"设 \\(m\\) 为正整数，数列 \\(a_1\\)，\\(a_2\\)，\\(\\dots\\)，\\(a_{4m+2}\\) 为公差不为 \\(0\\) 的等差数列，若删去两项 \\(a_i\\)，\\(a_j\\)（\\(i<j\\)） 后剩余 \\(4m\\) 项可平均分为 \\(m\\) 组且每组 4 个数都成等差，则称该数列为 \\((i,j)\\)-可分数列.\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 写出所有 \\((i,j)\\)，\\(1\\le i<j\\le6\\)，使 \\(a_1\\)，\\(\\dots\\)，\\(a_6\\) 是 \\((i,j)\\)-可分数列；\n\\item 当 \\(m\\ge3\\) 时，证明 \\(a_1\\)，\\(\\dots\\)，\\(a_{4m+2}\\) 是 \\((2,13)\\)-可分数列；\n\\item 从 \\(1\\)，\\(2\\)，\\(\\dots\\)，\\(4m+2\\) 中不放回任取 \\(i<j\\)，设 \\(a_1\\)，\\(\\dots\\)，\\(a_{4m+2}\\) 是 \\((i,j)\\)-可分数列的概率为 \\(P_m\\)，证明 \\(P_m>\\frac18\\).\n\\end{enumerate}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）$(1,2),(1,6),(5,6)$；（2）证明略；（3）证明略","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2024/new_gaokao_paper_1.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"77b974d8d692363d60c8d436b6c8624428bb0108","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_a